{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\ntypedef long long ll;\n\nconst int N=10005,S=N-2,T=N-1;\nconst int M=2e6+10;\nconst int inf=2e9;\n\nint head[N],to[M],nxt[M],w[M],c[M],cnt=1;\n\ninline void addedge(int x, int y, int flow, int cost){\n\tto[++cnt]=y,nxt[cnt]=head[x],head[x]=cnt;\n\tw[cnt]=flow,c[cnt]=cost;\n\tto[++cnt]=x,nxt[cnt]=head[y],head[y]=cnt;\n\tw[cnt]=0,c[cnt]=-cost;\n}\n\nqueue <int> q;\nlong long dis[N];\nbool mark[N];\n\ninline bool spfa(){\n\tmemset(mark,0,sizeof(mark));\n\tmemset(dis,0x3f,sizeof(dis));\n\tq.push(T); dis[T]=0; mark[T]=1;\n\twhile (!q.empty()){\n\t\tint x=q.front();\n\t\tmark[x]=0; q.pop();\n\t\tfor (int i=head[x];i;i=nxt[i]){\n\t\t\tint y=to[i];\n\t\t\tif (w[i^1]&&dis[y]>dis[x]+c[i^1]){\n\t\t\t\tdis[y]=dis[x]+c[i^1];\n\t\t\t\tif (!mark[y]){\n\t\t\t\t\tq.push(y); mark[y]=1;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn dis[S]<1e18;\n}\n\ninline int dfs(int x, int lim, ll &cost){\n\tint flow=0; mark[x]=1;\n\tif (x==T) return lim;\n\tfor (int i=head[x];i;i=nxt[i]){\n\t\tint y=to[i];\n\t\tif (!w[i]||mark[y]) continue;\n\t\tif (dis[x]!=dis[y]+c[i]) continue;\n\t\tint t=dfs(y,min(w[i],lim-flow),cost);\n\t\tw[i]-=t; w[i^1]+=t;\n\t\tflow+=t; cost+=t*c[i];\n\t\tif (flow==lim) return lim;\n\t}\n\treturn flow;\n}\n\ninline ll costflow(){\n\tint flow=0; ll cost=0;\n\twhile (spfa())\n\t\tdo{\n\t\t\tmemset(mark,0,sizeof(mark));\n\t\t\tflow+=dfs(S,inf,cost);\n\t\t}while (mark[T]);\n\treturn cost;\n}\n\nint main(){\n\tint n,m,k,c,d,lim=101;\n\tcin>>n>>m>>k>>c>>d;\n\tfor (int i=0;i<k;i++){\n\t\tint x; cin>>x; x--;\n\t\taddedge(S,x,1,0);\n\t}\n\tfor (int i=0;i<lim;i++)\n\t\taddedge(i*n,T,k,c*i);\n\tfor (int i=0;i<n;i++)\n\t\tfor (int j=0;j<lim-1;j++)\n\t\t\taddedge(i+j*n,i+(j+1)*n,k,0);\n\twhile (m--){\n\t\tint x,y; cin>>x>>y; x--,y--;\n\t\tfor (int i=0;i<lim-1;i++)\n\t\t\tfor (int j=k-1;~j;j--){\n\t\t\t\taddedge(x+i*n,y+(i+1)*n,1,d*(j<<1|1));\n\t\t\t\taddedge(y+i*n,x+(i+1)*n,1,d*(j<<1|1));\n\t\t\t}\n\t}\n\tcout<<costflow();\n\treturn 0;\n}\n\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "meta-llama/llama-3.1-8b-instruct"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.io.BufferedReader;\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.io.InputStreamReader;\nimport java.io.PrintWriter;\nimport java.util.ArrayDeque;\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.StringTokenizer;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static class Edge {\n        int to, flow, cost;\n        Edge rev;\n\n        public Edge(int to, int flow, int cost, Edge rev) {\n            this.to = to;\n            this.flow = flow;\n            this.cost = cost;\n            this.rev = rev;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static int N = 10005, M = 2000000, inf = 2000000000;\n    static int head[] = new int[N];\n    static Edge edges[] = new Edge[M];\n    static int cnt = 1;\n    static int dis[] = new int[N];\n    static boolean mark[] = new boolean[N];\n\n    static void addedge(int x, int y, int flow, int cost) {\n        edges[++cnt] = new Edge(y, flow, cost, edges[cnt - 1]);\n        edges[cnt - 1].rev = edges[cnt];\n        edges[cnt].rev.rev = edges[cnt];\n        edges[cnt].to = y;\n        edges[cnt].flow = flow;\n        edges[cnt].cost = cost;\n        edges[cnt - 1].to = x;\n        edges[cnt - 1].flow = 0;\n        edges[cnt - 1].cost = -cost;\n        head[x] = cnt - 1;\n    }\n\n    static ArrayDeque<Integer> q = new ArrayDeque<>();\n\n    static boolean spfa() {\n        Arrays.fill(mark, false);\n        Arrays.fill(dis, inf);\n        q.add(N - 1);\n        dis[N - 1] = 0;\n        mark[N - 1] = true;\n        while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n            int x = q.poll();\n            mark[x] = false;\n            for (int i = head[x]; i != -1; i = edges[i].rev.next) {\n                int y = edges[i].to;\n                if (edges[i].flow > 0 && dis[y] > dis[x] + edges[i].cost) {\n                    dis[y] = dis[x] + edges[i].cost;\n                    if (!mark[y]) {\n                        q.add(y);\n                        mark[y] = true;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return dis[0] < inf;\n    }\n\n    static int dfs(int x, int lim, long cost) {\n        int flow = 0;\n        mark[x] = true;\n        if (x == N - 1) return lim;\n        for (int i = head[x]; i != -1; i = edges[i].next) {\n            int y = edges[i].to;\n            if (edges[i].flow > 0 && dis[x] == dis[y] + edges[i].cost) {\n                int t = dfs(y, Math.min(edges[i].flow, lim - flow), cost);\n                edges[i].flow -= t;\n                edges[i].rev.flow += t;\n                flow += t;\n                cost += t * edges[i].cost;\n                if (flow == lim) return lim;\n            }\n        }\n        return flow;\n    }\n\n    static long costflow() {\n        int flow = 0;\n        long cost = 0;\n        while (spfa()) {\n            Arrays.fill(mark, false);\n            flow += dfs(0, inf, cost);\n        }\n        return cost;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        PrintWriter pw = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int k = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int c = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int d = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            int x = Integer.parseInt(br.readLine());\n            x--;\n            addedge(0, x, 1, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < 101; i++) {\n            addedge(i * n, N - 1, k, c * i);\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < 100; j++) {\n                addedge(i + j * n, i + (j + 1) * n, k, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        while (m-- > 0) {\n            st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n            int x = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n            int y = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n            x--;\n            y--;\n            for (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n                for (int j = k - 1; j >= 0; j--) {\n                    addedge(x + i * n, y + (i + 1) * n, 1, d * (j << 1 | 1));\n                    addedge(y + i * n, x + (i + 1) * n, 1, d * (j << 1 | 1));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        pw.println(costflow());\n        pw.close();\n    }\n}\n\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.13088925182819366, -0.004329264163970947, -0.20309188961982727, -0.005984714720398188, -0.0002156132395612076, -0.3876039683818817, -0.6461353302001953, -9.847171895671636e-05, -1.4662849935120903e-05, -7.271793037944008e-06, -2.8849064619862475e-05, -0.08585811406373978, -7.152560215217818e-07, -1.7881409348774469e-06, -7.033372639853042e-06, -3.4570753086882178e-06, -0.004640182014554739, -3.182938598911278e-05, -5.960482212685747e-06, -9.775209946383256e-06, -0.160826995